## How each field should work

Every row has two controls:

* Checkbox: Select or deselect the field to determine whether it appears on the student application form.

* Requirement dropdown: Choose `Required` or `Optional`.

For example:

First Name

Required

Middle Name(s)

Optional

Email Address

Required

Example of the field-selection controls, not the complete form.

If a field is deselected, it will not appear on the student application form. If selected as Required, the student must complete it before submitting. If selected as Optional, the student may leave it blank.

